cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the dataset, please cite them as below."
title: "Korean DUI Legal Judgment Prediction: Classical ML, LLMs, and Explanation Agreement (reproduction materials)"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction materials for a study of Legal Judgment Prediction on Korean
  drunk-driving cases: an attorney-verified benchmark of 1,500 cases from the
  LBox Open corpus, eight classical machine-learning configurations, four
  large-language-model configurations, and a comparison of the two families on
  both sentence prediction and explanation.
